Third-party notices for laterite-admin
======================================

This crate compiles the following third-party work into the binaries that use
it. Icons live in laterite-core; see its own NOTICE. Their licences are reproduced in full below, which is what the SIL Open
Font License and the ISC License ask for when the work travels with a
distribution.

An application that distributes a *built binary* carries this work too, and
inherits these notices. Tooling that gathers licences from dependencies (for
example `cargo about`) finds this file by name and folds it into your notice
automatically; Laterite's own generator does the same.


